<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tamsa started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tamsa started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities analyst Jamie Nicholson said he started coverage Friday of Mexico's Tubos de Acero de Mexico SA (Tamsa) with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- He praised Tamsa's &quot;continued strong business outlook&quot; as a &quot;core supplier&quot; to state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos. Pemex is markedly increasing its drilling program.</p>
<p>-- He estimated Tamsa's 1997 earnings per share at $2.69, and 1998 at $2.77.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
